abstract: >
  Creative-Writing-Rubrics 1.3.0 application release, distributing the unchanged
  Apache-2.0 HBQ-RS 1.2.1 rubric standard, with deterministic score aggregation
  and opt-in admission and decision-readiness tools. The application distribution
  has mixed licensing; the linked LICENSE defines component scope and preserves
  earlier grants.
